1
00:00:09,230 --> 00:00:10,350
(Passenger Drop-off Area)

2
00:00:36,389 --> 00:00:39,364
=Vow of Autumn=
=Episode 9=

3
00:00:43,100 --> 00:00:43,520
Let go.

4
00:00:46,340 --> 00:00:48,000
You haven't answered me.

5
00:00:49,600 --> 00:00:50,299
About what?

6
00:00:51,939 --> 00:00:53,679
That guy at dinner...

7
00:00:55,560 --> 00:00:57,039
What is he to you?

8
00:00:59,939 --> 00:01:00,560
Gu Yuan.

9
00:01:01,979 --> 00:01:02,960
What are we?

10
00:01:02,960 --> 00:01:03,859
Who are you to me?

11
00:01:03,859 --> 00:01:05,000
What gives you the right?

12
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:18,920
You tell me.

13
00:01:20,780 --> 00:01:22,099
What are we?

14
00:01:26,480 --> 00:01:28,040
Nothing.

15
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:29,640
We're just

16
00:01:30,721 --> 00:01:32,920
hooking up.

17
00:01:37,571 --> 00:01:38,372
Just hooking up?

18
00:01:40,840 --> 00:01:41,819
Why are you blushing?

19
00:01:45,859 --> 00:01:46,819
Are you blind?

20
00:01:47,319 --> 00:01:47,980
No, I'm not.

21
00:01:56,140 --> 00:01:57,340
Then let me ask you out,

22
00:01:58,760 --> 00:01:59,519
okay?

23
00:02:01,379 --> 00:02:02,459
Let's take our relationship

24
00:02:04,540 --> 00:02:05,379
one step further.

25
00:02:20,639 --> 00:02:21,439
Too late.

26
00:02:22,740 --> 00:02:24,060
I'm not interested

27
00:02:24,800 --> 00:02:25,560
in you anymore.

28
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:45,819
Wanqing, let me tell you.

29
00:02:46,460 --> 00:02:48,439
Guess who I saw at the restaurant.

30
00:02:48,659 --> 00:02:49,840
That jerk Gu Yuan!

31
00:02:50,139 --> 00:02:51,599
He was dining with another woman!

32
00:02:51,599 --> 00:02:52,919
Said it was work. Yeah, right.

33
00:02:57,919 --> 00:02:58,840
What's wrong?

34
00:03:14,960 --> 00:03:15,960
It's so late.

35
00:03:16,199 --> 00:03:17,360
What brings you here?

36
00:03:17,560 --> 00:03:19,120
You didn't even call.

37
00:03:19,639 --> 00:03:20,639
Trying to surprise me?

38
00:03:23,759 --> 00:03:25,300
Did you listen in on my call?

39
00:03:26,599 --> 00:03:27,319
What?

40
00:03:28,919 --> 00:03:30,039
At the hotel,

41
00:03:30,340 --> 00:03:31,680
I was on the phone with Wanqing.

42
00:03:32,360 --> 00:03:34,060
Did you hear her say

43
00:03:34,300 --> 00:03:35,599
Zhou Ze's ex-wife

44
00:03:35,599 --> 00:03:37,259
could give her evidence against him?

45
00:03:37,680 --> 00:03:39,319
So you followed that lead

46
00:03:39,319 --> 00:03:40,560
and learned what she'd found

47
00:03:40,560 --> 00:03:41,379
in the Zhao Group case?

48
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:47,219
You suspect me?

49
00:03:47,500 --> 00:03:49,120
You knew I was Wanqing's best friend.

50
00:03:49,379 --> 00:03:50,840
- So you kept asking me out.
- Su Mu.

51
00:03:54,060 --> 00:03:55,639
Do you have any idea what you're saying?

52
00:03:55,699 --> 00:03:56,419
Yes.

53
00:03:58,080 --> 00:04:00,340
You had an ulterior motive all along,
didn't you?

54
00:04:00,620 --> 00:04:01,659
You got close to me

55
00:04:02,199 --> 00:04:03,439
just to get information.

56
00:04:20,319 --> 00:04:21,040
Fine.

57
00:04:22,379 --> 00:04:23,540
If that's what you think,

58
00:04:25,160 --> 00:04:26,139
so be it.

59
00:05:34,560 --> 00:05:36,560
Your sister's inside.
She just fell asleep.

60
00:05:36,879 --> 00:05:37,560
I know.

61
00:05:38,019 --> 00:05:39,620
She called me earlier.

62
00:05:42,600 --> 00:05:44,639
Are you upset?

63
00:05:45,339 --> 00:05:46,519
Still no leads?

64
00:05:47,819 --> 00:05:48,540
No.

65
00:05:55,060 --> 00:05:55,699
A little.

66
00:05:57,839 --> 00:05:58,779
Do you trust me?

67
00:06:01,279 --> 00:06:02,120
If you do,

68
00:06:03,100 --> 00:06:04,079
I'll take you somewhere.

69
00:06:05,160 --> 00:06:06,199
But your sister...

70
00:06:06,199 --> 00:06:07,079
She's asleep.

71
00:06:07,639 --> 00:06:09,519
We'll be back before she wakes up.

72
00:06:37,140 --> 00:06:38,680
(Passenger Drop-off Area)

73
00:08:03,600 --> 00:08:04,680
In the middle of the night,

74
00:08:05,480 --> 00:08:06,680
you brought me this far?

75
00:08:08,720 --> 00:08:10,399
You said you had no leads.

76
00:08:11,699 --> 00:08:12,560
So stop thinking.

77
00:08:14,839 --> 00:08:15,839
Take a break.

78
00:08:16,339 --> 00:08:17,180
As for the rest,

79
00:08:17,540 --> 00:08:18,680
we'll talk after you catch your breath.

80
00:08:24,019 --> 00:08:25,120
Want to shout it out?

81
00:08:39,440 --> 00:08:40,440
Louder.

82
00:08:41,039 --> 00:08:42,000
Louder?

83
00:08:58,000 --> 00:08:59,980
Wen Wanqing!

84
00:09:01,200 --> 00:09:03,279
Pei Yiqiu!

85
00:09:04,139 --> 00:09:06,620
Don't be upset!

86
00:09:07,440 --> 00:09:08,820
I got it!

87
00:09:11,580 --> 00:09:14,379
Stop overthinking!

88
00:09:15,600 --> 00:09:17,360
Forget life!

89
00:09:18,820 --> 00:09:20,379
Forget sadness!

90
00:09:22,220 --> 00:09:24,019
Forget all our worries!

91
00:09:24,779 --> 00:09:26,740
Forget it all!

92
00:09:41,240 --> 00:09:42,039
Five!

93
00:09:42,840 --> 00:09:43,399
Four!

94
00:09:44,440 --> 00:09:45,080
Three!

95
00:09:45,980 --> 00:09:46,740
Two!

96
00:09:48,580 --> 00:09:49,059
One!

97
00:10:10,840 --> 00:10:11,679
Look.

98
00:10:12,519 --> 00:10:13,340
It's dawn.

99
00:10:43,417 --> 00:10:44,990
(Passenger Drop-off Area)
